    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime popup window component. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages a header, scrollable content area, and a footer with one or more action buttons. The PopupLayer overlay is automatically shown and hidden with this window. Construct instances through PopupBuilder rather than directly. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
